{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-ef9da0f26debfdf9ecc9e1428e3a6b675dd1c90a5f3e3c2b","family_id":"KR:002619","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"288439","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=288439","source_sha256":"6fddccc8dd40d065ba4af293d38ee89d2ecaf5b6b4ebb45961fc19ab8c83311e","body_sha256":"370184421e51c1409e00ba9afd8dc60159d6049fc8c91c2c5ff982d31cb771e8","article_count":0,"full_text":"ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 36235, Apr. 1, 2026>\nArticle 1 (Enforcement date)\nThis Decree shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation.\nArticle 2 (Applicability following temporary adjustment of flexible tax rates for gasoline and diesel)\n(1) The amended proviso of subparagraph 1 of Article 3-2 and the amended proviso of subparagraph 2 of that Article shall apply to articles shipped out from a manufacturing place or for which an import declaration is filed during the period from March 27, 2026 to May 31, 2026.\n(2) Where a taxpayer referred to in Article 3 of the Act files a report by April 30, 2026, with the head of the competent tax office or customs office, regarding articles for which the tax rate has been reduced under the amended proviso of Article 3-2, subparagraph 1 and the amended proviso of subparagraph 2 of that Article, and which were shipped out or for which an import declaration was filed during the period from March 27, 2026 to the day immediately preceding the enforcement date of this Decree, along with evidentiary documents prescribed by the Commissioner of the National Tax Service or the Commissioner of the Korea Customs Service, such as tax invoices, verifying such fact, the tax amount corresponding to the reduction in the tax rate under the amended proviso of subparagraph 1 of Article 3-2 and the amended proviso of subparagraph 2 of that Article shall be refunded or deducted from the tax amount payable.\n(3) Notwithstanding the amended proviso of subparagraph 1 of Article 3-2 and the amended proviso of subparagraph 2 of that Article, the previous provisions thereof shall apply to the traffic, energy, and environment tax rates on the articles which are shipped out from a manufacturing place or for which an import declaration is filed on or before March 26, 2026.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\8e2e9050b21e66a94716442d3ab905cf3e62d7fba1c7f01dc614daaaf818ce67.ascii.json","sha256":"8e2e9050b21e66a94716442d3ab905cf3e62d7fba1c7f01dc614daaaf818ce67"},"protocol":"WORKC_P04_1526_EXPLICIT_SOURCE_REVIEWED_AUTHOR_INPUT_V1","reviewed_source_units":[{"source_component_text_sha256":"b58ceaa3b283c34fba1ed7fcf7d227d83ec14a2f1a32ddf239eb98a4c2cb6b5d","unit_key":"addenda-24441-20130323"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"d48ac53f124c64248e5ff08cb361c3f4f9377a12ae520587d113681ffe9704b6","unit_key":"addenda-24638-20130628"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"99f73b3f81c1f5a6e57da2c61eeed9c447025f7f524c18c8715d31b4dd1e2340","unit_key":"addenda-29529-20190212"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"71f36deb1d5010473a20369ed9e28bd30cba38c8da38c1992f79056f638d1b4c","unit_key":"addenda-31380-20210105"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"834d5ecd9bfb078dfc1ce45830f3a3fd0029e6bf68b8c7ad9afc3bed522fb10b","unit_key":"addenda-35811-20251001"},{"source_component_text_sha256":"58553c42d2370456d0e1fb2bd24f7106bd1c86de3f1c13cf4ef09b5a7c34322d","unit_key":"addenda-3594